{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261103/photo/bkn-20261103110440730-1103_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261103154034\"/><p>傷者送院救治。</p><p>今早(3日)8時36分，西灣河一名姓馮(66歲)婦人，在西灣河街橫過馬路期間，遭一輛由太寧街右轉西灣河街的私家車撞及，當場倒地胸口及膝頭受傷。救護車接報抵達，把馮婦送往東區醫院救治。姓黃(54歲)私家車司機在場助查，案件列作交通意外有人受傷跟進。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:23:45.688630+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T03:04:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T10:59:09.196686+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:18:56.827056+00:00","content_hash":"0a6467519936b69f3c25e0aba196fb293d9c1d25bff1b15951def08ff2036d46","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}